    <string name="onb_1_title">What SkinNova does</string>
    <string name="onb_1_body">Take a photo of a skin concern and answer a few questions. SkinNova shows up to three possible categories, how sure it is, and when to see a doctor.</string>
    <string name="onb_2_title">Private and offline</string>
    <string name="onb_2_body">Everything runs on this phone. Your photos and answers are never uploaded. History is off unless you turn it on.</string>
    <string name="onb_3_title">Not a diagnosis</string>
    <string name="onb_3_body">SkinNova gives preliminary, educational information. It can be wrong. Only a doctor can diagnose a skin condition. In an emergency, seek care immediately.</string>
