        <item>Use sunscreen every day, even indoors near windows.</item>
        <item>Moisturise within 3 minutes of bathing to lock in water.</item>
        <item>Patch-test new products on your inner arm for 48 hours.</item>
        <item>Take scan photos in daylight, 15–20 cm from the skin.</item>
