    <string name="prof_about_body">SkinNova is for preliminary information and education. It does not replace a professional medical diagnosis.</string>
    <string name="about_sources">Data sources and licenses</string>
    <string name="about_sources_body">Image model trained on: PAD-UFES-20 (CC BY 4.0), SkinDisNet (CC BY-NC 4.0), DermNet NZ images via a Kaggle mirror (non-commercial, educational), mgmitesh Kaggle set (CC BY 4.0). Tested on SkinDiseaseBD (CC BY-NC 4.0). Language model: Gemma 4 E2B (Apache-2.0). Condition notes summarise AAD, NHS, DermNet and WHO public pages in our own words.</string>
    <string name="about_limits">Limitations</string>
    <string name="about_limits_body">Most training photos show lighter skin under clinical lighting, so results on brown and dark skin may be less reliable. The model only knows 11 broad categories. Voice input in languages other than Hindi and English is beta.</string>
